Description: Round ordinary and structurally owned Wine frames with scene masks
 Adapt per-theme corners and native border buffers, clip content and titlebar
 button hitboxes without clipping shadows or resize extents. Keep full/maximized
 frames square and exclude menus, tooltips, normal CSD and alpha surfaces.
